<%- include('../partials/header',{title:'Appearance studio'}) %>
<%- include('../partials/admin-nav') %>
<section class="container page-head admin-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DESIGN STUDIO · 2027</span><h1>Make this store yours.</h1><p>Control your customer-facing visual identity and optional storefront experiences. Everything is saved on the server. Existing orders, security settings and payment methods are untouched.</p></div><a class="btn btn-light" href="/shop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Preview shop ↗</a></section>
<section class="container form-page">
 <% if(error){ %><div class="alert" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
 <% if(saved){ %><div class="success-alert" role="status">Appearance settings saved and checked. Refresh the shop to see the changes.</div><% } %>
 <form action="/admin/appearance" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="panel form-stack appearance-form">
  <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
  <div class="form-section"><span class="eyebrow">01 · YOUR IDENTITY</span><h2>Brand signature</h2><p>Use a high-contrast primary colour for buttons and navigation. The theme checks the colour against white text before saving.</p>
   <div class="appearance-fields"><label>Primary brand colour<input type="color" name="brandPrimary" value="<%= appearance.brandPrimary %>" required></label><label>Highlight colour<input type="color" name="brandAccent" value="<%= appearance.brandAccent %>" required></label><label>Typography<select name="font"><option value="inter" <%= appearance.font==='inter'?'selected':'' %>>Inter — modern</option><option value="system" <%= appearance.font==='system'?'selected':'' %>>System — fastest</option><option value="editorial" <%= appearance.font==='editorial'?'selected':'' %>>Editorial — classic serif</option></select></label></div>
   <div class="appearance-logo-control"><img src="<%= safeImageUrl(appearance.logo||'/assets/logo.svg') %>" data-fallback-src="/assets/logo.svg" alt="Current store logo" width="90" height="90" decoding="async"><div><label for="shop-logo">Logo (PNG, JPG or WebP; up to 2 MiB)</label><input id="shop-logo" type="file" name="shopLogo" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"><label class="checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" name="removeLogo" value="1"> Remove my logo and restore the default</label><p class="field-note">Your store name is managed in <a href="/admin/branding">Storefront branding</a>.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-section"><span class="eyebrow">02 · CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE</span><h2>Optional features</h2><p>Off means the relevant control and client-side feature are not rendered to customers. Existing inventory and customer data are never erased.</p>
   <div class="appearance-switch-grid">
    <% const options=[['darkMode','Customer dark-mode switch','Allow customers to choose a dark theme.'],['motion','Subtle animations','Respect reduced-motion settings.'],['quickView','Quick product preview','Open a lightweight, accessible product preview.'],['compare','Compare products','Up to three products in a customer-controlled comparison.'],['recentlyViewed','Recently viewed','Keep a short list in this browser session only.'],['stickyPurchase','Mobile purchase shortcut','Link to the real purchase form on small screens.'],['freeShipping','Free-shipping progress','Only display after your offer and threshold are correctly configured.'],['newsletter','Newsletter management','Manage previously confirmed subscribers and campaigns. The storefront signup block is not displayed.'],['reviews','Verified customer reviews','Only completed-order customers can submit; Manager approval required.'],['stockAlerts','Back-in-stock alerts','Send an email only after confirmation and a real Manager restock.'],['cartDrawer','Cart preview drawer','Read-only cart summary; normal cart and checkout still work.'],['countrySuggestion','Country and language suggestion','Optional browser-language suggestion, without IP geolocation.'],['filterChips','Active filter summary','Show removable filters above product results. Helps buyers see which filters are applied.']]; %>
    <% options.forEach(([key,label,info])=>{ %><label class="appearance-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="<%= key %>" <%= appearance[key]?'checked':'' %>><span><strong><%= label %></strong><small><%= info %></small></span></label><% }) %>
   </div>
   <label for="free-shipping-minimum">Free-shipping threshold in store currency minor units (0 disables the progress)</label><input id="free-shipping-minimum" name="freeShippingMinimum" type="number" min="0" max="100000000" step="1" value="<%= appearance.freeShippingMinimum %>"><p class="field-note">Example: for EUR, 7500 = €75.00. For IQD, the store uses 3 fractional currency digits. A progress bar is informational only; it never changes shipping fees in the order calculator. Only enable if the real shipping rules offer free delivery at this amount in ALL eligible zones.</p>
  </div>
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-dark btn-wide">Save design &amp; optional features</button>
 </form>
 <div class="panel"><h2>Shop launch checklist</h2><div class="appearance-wizard"><a href="/admin/branding"><strong>1. Identity</strong><span>Store name, homepage message and hero</span></a><a href="/admin/products"><strong>2. Catalogue</strong><span>Real product photos, stock and variants</span></a><a href="/admin/settings"><strong>3. Commerce &amp; policies</strong><span>Tax, deliveries, payment, legal information, AI and other toggles</span></a><a href="/shop"><strong>4. Preview</strong><span>Check desktop, mobile and each enabled language</span></a></div></div>
<section class="container section-tight" aria-label="Belgian electronic invoicing advisory"><div class="panel"><h2>Belgian business invoicing</h2><p>For transactions within the mandatory Belgian B2B structured e-invoicing regime (in force since 1 January 2026), ordinary order receipts or PDF invoices are not substitutes for compliant structured e-invoices. This storefront does not claim Peppol integration: connect a qualifying accounting or invoicing service separately before issuing applicable business invoices.</p></div></section>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/footer',{managerWorkspaceShell:user?.role==='manager'}) %>
